<title>ITALY: Gross yield 6.33 pct on 3-month Italian BOTs.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 6.33 pct on 3-month Italian BOTs.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 30.0 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.33	(6.45)    98.43	  (98.40)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.53	(6.39)    96.83	  (96.88)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.38	(6.33)    94.00	  (94.05)</p>
<p>Note: results compare with a previous auction on July 10.</p>
</text>
